# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:103
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_ffd88855:

    # "As I approached the gates, two guards crossed their halberds in front of me."
    "Подойдя к воротам, я увидел как два стражника скрестили передо мной алебарды."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:106
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_62408989:

    # "One of the guards addressed me with a heavy, hallowing voice:"
    "Один из стражей обратился ко мне низким, гулким голосом:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:108
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_87c5b731:

    # GUARD "Your leave permit, scout."
    GUARD "Ваш пропуск на уход, разведчик."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:109
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_e79ed82a:

    # MC "Huh?"
    MC "А?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:110
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_f00a0734:

    # GUARD "Present your leave permit, as dispatched by your direct commanding officer."
    GUARD "Предъявите пропуск на уход, выданный вашим непосредственным командиром."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:111
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_db7eaca7:

    # "The guard sized me up."
    "Страж оценивающе посмотрел на меня."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:112
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_29634847:

    # GUARD "That would be Captain Duprey."
    GUARD "Это был бы капитан Дюпре."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:113
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_684e944c:

    # GUARD "And I suspect you have no such permit."
    GUARD "И я подозреваю, что у вас нет такого пропуска."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:115
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_11238190:

    # GUARD "About-turn!"
    GUARD "Кругом!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:116
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_45c36ccf:

    # "I watched them stand still for a moment and then turned around, disappointed."
    "Я понаблюдал, как они замерли на мгновение, затем развернулся и ушёл разочарованным."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:118
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_391d3752:

    # MC "(It seems like I'm not getting out anytime soon.)"
    MC "(Похоже, я не скоро отсюда выберусь.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:119
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_73ac8739:

    # GUARD "Double-march!"
    GUARD "Двойным шагом, марш!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:120
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_18c47396:

    # MC "*Sigh* Sir yes sir..."
    MC "*Вздох* Так точно, сэр..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:126
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_61356499:

    # "That was the building they dragged that poor recruit towards."
    "Это было здание, куда волокли того бедного новобранца."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:127
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_a65eabce:

    # "Rows of actual comfy beds, shelves full of various potions and tools, civilian-looking people hurrying about past me..."
    "Ряды настоящих удобных кроватей, полки, заставленные различными зельями и инструментами, гражданские на вид люди, спешащие мимо меня..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:128
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_172c8f4d:

    # "It was clearly a section of the fort fully devoted to supporting our physical well-being."
    "Это явно была часть форта, полностью посвящённая поддержанию нашего физического благополучия."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:130
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_e5bd48af:

    # RECRUIT "Ow! What are you~"
    RECRUIT "Ай! Что вы~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:131
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_3fa31f5f:

    # "Over at the corner of the room, a nurse and a physician were likely putting that recruit's face back together."
    "В углу комнаты медсестра и врач, вероятно, собирали лицо того новобранца обратно."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:132
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_098a2684:

    # "As I remembered the scene in vivid details, a snapping sound echoed across the room."
    "Пока я вспоминал эту сцену в ярких деталях, по комнате прокатился звук хруста."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:134
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_49cf0693:

    # RECRUIT "{b}Aaaagh!!!{/b}"
    RECRUIT "{b}Ааааа!!!{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:135
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_c20f5bef:

    # MC "(On the upside, he won't have no face time with Captain Duprey anytime soon.)"
    MC "(С другой стороны, он не скоро увидится лицом к лицу с капитаном Дюпре.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:136
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_48a8e4c1:

    # MC "(I should go to the training area now.)"
    MC "(Мне стоит сейчас отправиться в тренировочную зону.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:137
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_73f8592e:

    # MC "(I don't want to end up in here, one way or another.)"
    MC "(Я не хочу оказаться здесь, так или иначе.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:141
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_d0e0fdb1:

    # "I approached the door and a guard standing beside it turned to face me:"
    "Я подошёл к двери, и стоящий рядом охранник повернулся ко мне:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:144
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_3d0d779c:

    # GUARD "You have no business at the Captains office, recruit."
    GUARD "Тебе нечего делать в кабинете Капитана, новобранец."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:145
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_a6793028:

    # "His tone was even but surprisingly chill."
    "Его тон был ровным, но на удивление спокойным."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:146
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_ba40941c:

    # MC "Yeah, I'm just looking around."
    MC "Да, я просто осматриваюсь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:147
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_ec88e290:

    # GUARD "Sure, just don't bother me as you play inquisitor around here."
    GUARD "Конечно, только не мешай мне, пока играешь в следователя здесь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:148
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_6c2dfd73:

    # "I nodded and stepped back."
    "Я кивнул и отступил."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:150
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_2f9aca4a:

    # MC "(A guard who doesn't sound like he's eating babies for breakfast, who would've thought.)"
    MC "(Охранник, который не звучит так, будто завтракает младенцами, кто бы мог подумать.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:154
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantGoToMedwardOrTrainArea_c1db863b:

    # "I should go to the barracks as instructed."
    "Мне следует отправиться в казармы, как и было приказано."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:155
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CantGoToMedwardOrTrainArea_0d4c21ad:

    # "Last thing I want is for these guards to skewer me for displaying any disobedience..."
    "Последнее, чего я хочу, — чтобы эти стражи пронзили меня за проявление неповиновения..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:159
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_21ccfdff:

    # "I was approached by a rather hostile-looking guard."
    "Ко мне подошёл довольно враждебно выглядящий стражник."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:162
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_2bb61eb1:

    # GUARD "Recruit! What are you doing loitering about after dark?!"
    GUARD "Новобранец! Что ты делаешь, слоняясь без дела после наступления темноты?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:163
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_e55c35a9:

    # MC "I was just~"
    MC "Я просто~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:165
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_d07274a3:

    # GUARD "I will escort you to your bunk now!"
    GUARD "Я сопровожу тебя до твоей койки сейчас же!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:166
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_0db79806:

    # MC "*Sigh* Alright, alright..."
    MC "*Вздох* Ладно, ладно..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:169
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_a94b4f28:

    # "The guard did as he declared, following me around and even standing beside me as I was undressing to go to bed."
    "Стражник сделал так, как заявил, следуя за мной и даже стоя рядом, пока я раздевался, чтобы лечь спать."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:170
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_d738ea4e:

    # GUARD "Sweet dreams, soldier!"
    GUARD "Сладких снов, солдат!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:181
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_YourBunk_1a080f4b:

    # "My bunk."
    "Моя койка."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:195
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_YourBunk_0fa8e0c6:

    # MC "(I won't be allowed any pillow-time with the sun still up.)"
    MC "(Мне не позволят подремать, пока солнце ещё высоко.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:219
